<div class="about-page">

  <div class="about-hero">
    <h1 class="about-headline">
      <span class="about-headline-primary">Get dressed.</span>
      <span class="about-headline-secondary">Feel like yourself.</span>
    </h1>
  </div>

  <div class="about-body">
    <p class="about-lead">You know getting dressed is a daily act of intention. Styley exists to remind you.</p>

       <ul class="about-everyone-list">
        <li>The ER nurse on her only night out.</li>
        <li>The teenager going to prom in a small town.</li>
        <li>Your grandpa on his way to watch birds at the park.</li>
      </ul>

    <p class="about-text">We all have a style north star — an instinct for how clothes make us feel, and how we need to feel to meet the moment. Styley helps you find yours: your closet distilled into feelings and purpose, with an editorial eye when you need it.</p>

    <div class="about-tenets">
      <span>No trends.</span>
      <span>No algorithm.</span>
      <span>No overthinking.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="about-everyone">
      <p>Everyone deserves to dress with purpose.</p>
    </div>

    <% unless current_user.present? %>
      <div class="about-cta">
        <a href="/users/sign_up" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg about-cta-btn">Get started</a>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>

</div>
